				    <tr>
					    <td colspan="7" height="30" align="center" class="title">산업리포트 요약(2026.06.17)</td>
				    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="hd">기관명/작성자</td>
                        <td class="hd">산업명</td>                        
                        <td class="hd" colspan="2">투자의견</td>
                        <td class="hd">이전의견</td>
						<td class="hd">제목</td>
